research/audit/wave12-certifier-tasks/a6-thm-norm-inequality-for-the-vector-valued-integral.md-356-title: "For $a \\le b$ and integrable $f : [a,b] \\to \\mathbb{R}^m$, $\\lVert f\\rVert_2$ is integrable and $\\bigl\\lVert\\int_a^b f\\bigr\\rVert_2 \\le \\int_a^b \\lVert f\\rVert_2$"
