research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-198-## Mathematical review and triage
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-199-
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-200-- The full Steinitz proof was checked against the exact theorem in S. Its bound
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-201-  $n$ is the classical arbitrary-norm dimension bound, and the on-disk
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-202-  polytope/support argument licenses the permutation conclusion. The wording
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-203-  that a stage is “determined” suppresses finite witness choices, but only
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-204-  finite choice is involved and the gap is closed immediately from the finite
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-205-  nonempty candidate sets; it falls under the standing 30-second rule.
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-206-- `thm-rearrangement-sums-lie-in-an-affine-subspace` proves only containment.
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-207-  R proves the stronger Levy–Steinitz affine-subspace equality, so the published
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-208-  weaker direction is sound and not misleading about what its own proof
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-209-  establishes.
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md:210:- In `thm-norm-inequality-for-the-vector-valued-integral`, the symbol $K$ is
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-211-  used before its explicit definition later in the same proof; the intended
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-212-  compact image is immediate from the next block. This is nonfatal under the
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-213-  standing rule.
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-214-- The iterated-limit counterexample suppresses one elementary rescaling in its
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-215-  epsilon estimate. The displayed denominator estimate supplies it in under 30
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-216-  seconds.
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-217-- All other proof steps, Remarks, and false-statement witnesses were read with
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-218-  proof-step suspicion. No additional repair class (a), (b), or (d) proposal
research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.findings.md-219-  survived the standing triage rule.
